A line at a body's column after a plus-attached quote holding an empty div stays in the body

```
- +
> :::
  x
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <div>

      </div>
    </blockquote>
    x
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
: +
> :::
  x
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <div>

      </div>
    </blockquote>
    <p>x</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```
